      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "cat_in_historical_building",
      "label": "cat_sitting_in_grand_architectural_space",
      "description": "A tabby cat with green eyes is sitting upright in the center of a grand, ornate historical building, likely a church or mosque, with sunlight streaming through a window. The cat is the focal point, positioned directly under the light beam, creating a stark contrast with the grandeur of the architecture. The overlaid text reads, \"what are you doing there? you're a cat, not a jew,\" which frames the scene as a hateful antisemitic trope using the cat as a stand-in for Jewish people.",
