      "label": "Antisemitic Stereotype Equating Jews with Cats",
      "description": "A long-standing antisemitic trope that caricatures Jewish people as cats, often used to imply Jewish people are unwelcome, inappropriate, or inherently associated with certain negative traits in sacred or public spaces. This stereotype is rooted in centuries of antisemitic propaganda and is a form of hate speech.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
